WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.056 --> 00:00:05.359
Mole ate a pickle, and Badger ate some beef.

2
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.127
"Toad, we walked all around your place," said Mole.

3
00:00:10.128 --> 00:00:12.569
"The ferrets are everywhere.

4
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:17.080
They shoot bullets and throw stones."

5
00:00:17.081 --> 00:00:20.385
"And they laugh!" added Toad.

6
00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:23.179
Rat thought deeply.

7
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.992
"Well, I think it's clear," Rat said.

8
00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:29.161
"Toad should try to—"

9
00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:33.445
"Now wait," said Mole, his mouth full.

10
00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:36.708
"First, Toad should—"

11
00:00:36.709 --> 00:00:40.863
"You can't tell me what to do!" cried Toad.

12
00:00:40.864 --> 00:00:45.416
"It's [i@my@i] house, and [i@I'll@i] say what we do!"

13
00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:49.881
Mole, Toad, and Rat all shouted at once.

14
00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:53.089
They all had different plans.

15
00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:59.367
"Everyone be quiet!" shouted another voice.

16
00:00:59.368 --> 00:01:02.736
It was Badger.

17
00:01:02.737 --> 00:01:05.060
They stopped yelling.

18
00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:08.667
Badger finished eating his pie.

19
00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.867
"Mole's right," Badger said.

20
00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:16.597
"The Wild-Wooders are too strong for us."

21
00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:21.780
"Then it's all over!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:27.849
"I'll never get Toad Hall back!"

23
00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.887
He burst into tears.

24
00:01:31.888 --> 00:01:35.706
Badger looked at them calmly.

25
00:01:35.707 --> 00:01:40.228
"There is a way," he said.

26
00:01:40.229 --> 00:01:44.311
"We can defeat the weasels and ferrets."

27
00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:47.629
They all looked at him.

28
00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:52.787
"I'm going to tell you a secret," said Badger.

29
00:01:52.788 --> 00:01:55.744
Toad sat up.

30
00:01:55.745 --> 00:01:58.504
He loved secrets.

31
00:01:58.505 --> 00:02:03.019
Of course he never could keep them.

